mber","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T06:55:23-07:00","id":1230266,"title":"","content":"I think the tried and true classics (a t-shirt, extra art, and a companion) will appear. Honestly, the companion is the thing I hope they focus on the most. Mortal necromancers would be incredibly useful as an antagonist splat, and extra detail on the Underworld would be useful to almost every storyteller.<br /> <br /> Naturally, I want creepy glow-in-the-dark dice, but I think that is unlikely at best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/693-thomasm","name":"ThomasM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar693_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T06:56:27-07:00","id":1230267,"title":"","content":"Long shot. But. Dice. <br /> They were never released with the original core. And i\u2019d Enjoy having them. <br /> <br /> On a realistic angle. <br /> A new night horrors book or companion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T07:03:49-07:00","id":1230269,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>Player's Guide</li> <li>Storyteller's Guide</li> <li>Companion (if a combination of the above two)</li> <li>Guidebook to the Underworld - an In-Universe travelogue containing all manner of weirdness to be found in the Great Below (with mechanics in side-bars and after-sections).</li> <li>Story Anthology</li> <li>Night Horrors (antagonist examples, and a new antagonist type)</li> <li>A book on side characters - Mortal Necromancers, Ghost Krewe members, Ghost-born, etc.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T07:47:13-07:00","id":1230279,"title":"","content":"A jumpstart/quickstart would be nice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T07:47:13-07:00","id":1230280,"title":"","content":"A Giest novel and Companion. Maybe some new antagonists, new Giest Digital Dice. Something that blows my mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T07:56:44-07:00","id":1230282,"title":"","content":"I'd like something about Sin Eaters through the Ages. Sin Eaters come in cycles*, almost like mummies, and the Underworld itself has changed a lot during the history (and prehistory) of mankind.<br /> <br /> *Or, more accurately, used to<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Italian nuisance. English is my second language, so be patient!<br /> <br /> <b>My homebrew:</b><br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/270766-domain-light-from-a-dead-star-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">[VtR 2e] Light From a Dead Star: Rome</span></a></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1117941-hunting-ground-the-past-is-another-country-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#8B4513\"><b>[WtF 2e] The Past Is Another Country: Rome</b></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3765-snesferatu","name":"SNESferatu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3765_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T08:36:42-07:00","id":1230292,"title":"","content":"I'll second the Jumpstart","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T09:02:16-07:00","id":1230302,"title":"","content":"Wraith-Geist Translation Guide please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T09:38:53-07:00","id":1230306,"title":"","content":"They've released a fiction anthology with each core book thus far, and I doubt they'll stop now so that's an add on instead of a stretch goal. Other fiction stretch goals will likely come in the form of separately released novellas rather than a second anthology.<br /> <br /> Jumpstart and companion are two extremely likely stretch goals. I'd be interested in the companion depending on what they put in it.<br /> <br /> I personally hope for a Guide to the Underworld book, but whether it's even a feasible source book depends both on how much of the core book is focused on the Underworld, and how much the Underworld has changed between editions. The Onyx Path will likely not just rerelease a new Book of the Dead if the old one is 95% compatible with second edition. But if they do release one, I hope it will contain at least half a chapter (or an equivalent amount of text spread out in the whole book) dedicated to how the other splats interacts with the Underworld.<br /> <br /> SNESferatu mentioned an Ancient Mysteries-type book. While I think that concept has been replaced with Dark Eras, I wouldn't mind a potential Guide to the Underworld to contain historical information about the Underworld. Dead Dominions change all the time and are not particularly interesting other than as an ST resource, but the Sundered World revealed a pretty dramatic change in the Underworld's geography and I'd like to see that explored more, including whatever changes the Underworld might currently be undergoing.<br /> <br /> A book focused on template variations and/or minor templates like Half-Damned and Heirs to Hell could be interesting. Depends on what they would include in it, and how well they handled it. My opinions about Half-Damned and Heirs to Hell are quite different so I'm not going to hype this kind of book like I would with a potential Guide to the Underworld book.<br /> <br /> Did I mention that I want a Guide to the Underworld book yet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T09:51:46-07:00","id":1230311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230306#post1230306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">SNESferatu mentioned an Ancient Mysteries-type book. While I think that concept has been replaced with Dark Eras, I wouldn't mind a potential Guide to the Underworld to contain historical information about the Underworld. Dead Dominions change all the time and are not particularly interesting other than as an ST resource, but the Sundered World revealed a pretty dramatic change in the Underworld's geography and I'd like to see that explored more, including whatever changes the Underworld might currently be undergoing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not whole replaced it seems. Remember that the only announced supplement for Hunter 2e is Eternal Flame, which sounds to be exactly like Ancient Bloodlines/Mysteries for Hunter. So a Geist version isn't completely implausible (he says hopefully).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T12:23:22-07:00","id":1230345,"title":"","content":"Night Horrors Book, Jumpstart, Player's and Story teller's Guide, Guide to the Underworld or just a straight up Underworld Setting book like Changeling's Hedge book (Though Mage has the Fallen Worlds book with the Underworld in it), A Krewe book, or maybe a bound society/culture/history book in the same vein as a Pack book like Werewolf got would be neat, I would love dice as an option. I think a purified/abmortals combo book would be neat","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T14:03:20-07:00","id":1230359,"title":"","content":"Night Horrors.<br /> <br /> Night Horroooooooooooooooors.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, a Player/Storyteller Guides would be nice. Something in the style of Half Damned would also be good, with mediums and other death touched beings. An updated Book of the Dead is also something I would like to see, as well as something about expanding upon krewes around the world, with examples to how they incorporate local death traditions into their own mythologies. Oh, and something about krewes in general, like the Pack for Werewolf. Probably it would take the form of the Player's Guide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T14:12:09-07:00","id":1230361,"title":"","content":"Dice pilfered from graves.<br /> <br /> That is all.<br /> <br /> (Okay, also, I imagine there won't be stretch goals for the Player's Guide, Stoyrteller's Guide, and Night Horrors because those will probably invariably come out anyways now.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T14:41:07-07:00","id":1230369,"title":"","content":"y'know an idea i just had? An skull ring,but one with the Geist Skull,that cool one with the key.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T14:50:25-07:00","id":1230373,"title":"","content":"I'd like dice that look like they're made of bone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T15:39:16-07:00","id":1230382,"title":"","content":"So in the original &quot;All Saints\u001b' day preview&quot; the <b>Catabasis </b>endgame was mentioned with the possibility` of krews forming their own dead dominions, although possibly out of the scope of the Kickstarter or even the game,<br /> I\u001b would love a book on how to run your dead dominion?<br /> <br /> Something that was done with the some of the 20th-anniversary\u001b editions was cookbooks, now I'm not sure how it would work with CofD, but I do love a good cookbook.<br /> <br /> I would back the idea of a side character book, mortal necromancers - a giest way, not proximi with death gifts, ghost blooded - if that a thing in CofD.<br /> <br /> would never turn down a Jumpstart. Novelas are a nice idea.<br /> <br /> Plushie Kerberoi?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T20:22:31-07:00","id":1230448,"title":"","content":"I didn't even think about dice. But now that it's mentioned: please dear God a stretch goal for dice. Bone-dice would be the coolest thing ever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","name":"Enokh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T04:25:42-07:00","id":1230492,"title":"","content":"Ooh,\u001b something else I want, Posters, particularly 'the book of the dead' cover as a poster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T17:05:54-07:00","id":1230683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230306#post1230306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A book focused on template variations and/or minor templates like Half-Damned and Heirs to Hell could be interesting. Depends on what they would include in it, and how well they handled it. My opinions about Half-Damned and Heirs to Hell are quite different so I'm not going to hype this kind of book like I would with a potential Guide to the Underworld book.<br /> <br /> Did I mention that I want a Guide to the Underworld book yet?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Guide to the Underworld book would be pretty Boss. It's pretty much stated to be almost as much (if not more) of a living breathing NPC like any other NPC the ST would use in a story. Really getting the ins and outs and examples and variations and all that Jazz that an ST could use would be pretty Boss. <br /> <br /> I'll agree on the Template-Variation Sourcebook being highly dependent on what the variations would be. Heirs to Hell just made sense really given snippet we got from the DtD core book. But it shouldn't be a thing that's forced. Haven't read Half-Damned but I'd rather not see dev time spent on a topic neither they nor we would want simply because there's Sourcebooks like it. I don't think it's likely given the direction OPP generally has especially for the 2nd Editions so there's prolly no real worry. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230361#post1230361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dice pilfered from graves.<br /> <br /> That is all.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Gotta say, as crazy immoral as it would be to roll dice created from pilfered bones from graves would be one of the most immersive way to play a game about dead people.<br /> <br /> But also, crazy badness.<br /> <br /> Woah, wait. What if a S-E character does just that. Prolly for some sort of Ceremony or something. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T17:06:32-07:00","id":1230684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ahather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230492#post1230492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooh,\u001b something else I want, Posters, particularly 'the book of the dead' cover as a poster.</div> </div> </div> </div>I, too, loved that cover. I\u2019m not sure where I\u2019d hang it, but I sure wouldn\u2019t mind having such a poster.<br /> Mostly, the stretch goals I\u2019d be interested in would be things that expanded the line. A companion book that expanded on juicy bits of the core would be great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T10:11:26-07:00","id":1230847,"title":"","content":"Digital Dice add on that are Bone white but glow underworld black when you roll a 10<br /> the settings chapter to include either San Antonio or Galveston<br /> Players Guide &amp; Storytellers guide expansions<br /> An article on how the local belief on Hell (eastern vs Western vs None) affects the underworld if at all<br /> for a super biggie, Roll 20 game run by the Line Dev for you and 3-4 other folks<br /> Book on Crewes like the Packs book for Werewolf.<br /> the ritual to use Terry Crewes as your avatar for your Crewe<br /> The affect the various ceremonies held to honor the fallen have on the underworld. not just dia de los muertos, but also Memorial day, pearl harbor day or 9/11<br /> The role of the supernatural community in the Funerary industry<br /> Archaeology vs Grave Robbing and the lengths the dead will go to get their stuff back<br /> <br /> Needs to be tuesday now. <br /> (best yoda voice) MY MONEY, YOU MUST TAKE NOW, YEAS","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T11:26:01-07:00","id":1230872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230683#post1230683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Gotta say, as crazy immoral as it would be to roll dice created from pilfered bones from graves would be one of the most immersive way to play a game about dead people.<br /> <br /> But also, crazy badness.<br /> <br /> Woah, wait. What if a S-E character does just that. Prolly for some sort of Ceremony or something.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;God does not play with dice, but he does play with lives, and that's basically the same thing.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:05:15-07:00","id":1230881,"title":"","content":"If I recall, human belief doesn't shape the Underworld in 2e. There are things in the Underworld that represent culture in the vaguest sense and it's likely cultures based off beliefs of those underworlds by tellings from someone who has been there and then just filled in the gaps/&quot;romanticized&quot; it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:54:17-07:00","id":1230900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Runcible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230881#post1230881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I recall, human belief doesn't shape the Underworld in 2e. There are things in the Underworld that represent culture in the vaguest sense and it's likely cultures based off beliefs of those underworlds by tellings from someone who has been there and then just filled in the gaps/&quot;romanticized&quot; it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that and the inhabitants of the Underworld probably held those beliefs when they brought them down there. Feedback loop, probably.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T14:07:53-07:00","id":1230915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1230263-geist-stretch-goals?p=1230900#post1230900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, that and the inhabitants of the Underworld probably held those beliefs when they brought them down there. Feedback loop, probably.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are what you eat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-02T07:24:00-07:00","id":1231801,"title":"","content":"Probably a bit unlikely, but I'll pitch in and say I'd also love to see a physical dice option in the style of the nWoD dice they had for Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, and Promethean. I'm dyscalculic and the differently colored numbers for eights, nines, and tens helped me a lot to pick out successes. I tend to get my sixes and nines mixed up, and the lines/dots that most d10s have to differentiate the two don't help as much as you'd think for me. Also, the little drawstring bags with the skull logos embossed on them were cute. I had a chance to get the Werewolf ones ages ago for a reasonable price but didn't, and now I've been kicking myself ever since. Geist-themed dice for the digital app are good too, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raziel MacPhereson, he/they | <a href=\"http://twitter.com/beastsoulfury\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Raziel%20MacPhereson\" target=\"_blank\">STV Content</a> | <a href=\"https://huntunderironskies.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23812-cherubic","name":"Cherubic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23812_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-02T08:15:23-07:00","id":1231813,"title":"","content":"I myself am don't have the opportunity to afford overseas shipping so I'm mainly excited for supplements as stretch goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-03T06:17:05-07:00","id":1232103,"title":"","content":"I want a certificate certifying my corebook is haunted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-10T16:13:10-07:00","id":1233837,"title":"","content":"Having gone through the second manuscript preview (and the bonus appendix preview) I think <b>condition cards</b> would be a very, very helpful stretch goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T23:16:16-07:00","id":1236313,"title":"","content":"Now that the Geist digital dice have been unlocked, I made a work in progress copy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/v1J7dqz\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/v1J7dqz\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/v1J7dqz\" target=\"_blank\"> https://imgur.com/a/v1J7dqz </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Lucky for everyone involved, I don't do the art.<br /> <br /> In all seriousness, Geist is one of the dice we've been most excited to do. Anything with a fog art style is really cool to work with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}